<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113812" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χερνίπτομαι</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ψομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>IT</u>
					622
				</span></i>
			: 
				Med.
			: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χείρ,
				νίζω</span>):—<i>wash one's hands with holy
			water,</i> esp. before sacrifice, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χερνίψαντο δ᾽ ἔπειτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1.449
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτός γε χερνίπτου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pax</u>
					961
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐχερνίψατο ἐκ τῆς ἱερᾶς χέρνιβος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					6.52
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>sprinkle with holy water, purify</i> or <i>dedicate thereby,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαίτην</span> E.l.c. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χερνίπτω</span></b> ,
			<i>sacrifice,</i> only <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				184
			</span></i>:—aor.
			
				Pass.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χερνιφθείς</span>”
				<i>dedicated,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					AP
					6.156
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Theodorid.
			</span></i>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
